# The one environment docs visual baselines (toHaveScreenshot) are produced and
# verified in. Pixel output depends on the OS fonts, fontconfig, Chromium build
# and software renderer, none of which a host machine or CI runner provides
# reproducibly, so every gate with screenshot baselines runs inside this image
# through scripts/playwright-pinned.sh, on any runner or on a developer
# machine.
#
# PLAYWRIGHT_VERSION must equal the locked @playwright/test version (the image
# carries that exact Playwright's browsers); the digest pins the image bytes.
# To move: update both here and the @playwright/test devDependency, then
# regenerate every baseline with
#   apps/docs/scripts/playwright-pinned.sh -- npm run test:e2e -w @kryv/teal-docs -- --update-snapshots
# and review the image diffs. Never edit a threshold to absorb a drift.
PLAYWRIGHT_VERSION=1.62.0
PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE=mcr.microsoft.com/playwright@sha256:baed2032d533817f3dbe6425de795788430ba345e819a1201337009ba17c9d07
